### Get all bookings
GET http://localhost:8080/api/bookings

### Cancel booking 3 (within 24h -> 50% refund)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/bookings/3/cancel
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "CHANGE_OF_PLANS"
}

### Check refund status for booking 3
GET http://localhost:8080/api/refunds/booking/3

### Move refund 1 to PROCESSED
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/refunds/1/process

### Move refund 1 to COMPLETED
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/refunds/1/complete
